{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/issues/4","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RMYPG/edity-sandbox","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/issues/4/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/issues/4/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/issues/4/events","html_url":"https://github.com/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/pull/4","id":6104196821,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVWyoCM8AAAABLk7W2w","number":4,"title":"Keep every pending release, and name Publish runs by commit","user":{"login":"MarioRP-01","id":74364145,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MzY0MTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74364145?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRP-01","html_url":"https://github.com/MarioRP-01","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRP-01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRP-01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRP-01/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRP-01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRP-01/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRP-01/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRP-01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRP-01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarioRP-01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-29T16:36:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T16:36:10Z","closed_at":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/pulls/4","html_url":"https://github.com/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/pull/4","diff_url":"https://github.com/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/pull/4.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/pull/4.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Two fixes to the release-on-Publish workflows from edity ticket 27, found while building edity-server's Publish status (edity ticket 22).\n\n- **`release.yml`: `queue: max` on the job's concurrency.** The default queue keeps one pending run and cancels the waiting one when another joins. When CI for a newer Publish finishes before an older one's, while a release is running, the older run cancels the newer, and the newer Publish is never released. With `queue: max` every pending run waits its turn ([GitHub docs](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/workflow-syntax#jobsjob_idconcurrency)), and the existing \"already released\" check turns the older run into a no-op.\n- **`release-on-publish.yml`: `run-name: Release <sha>`**, the commit CI ran on. Every run was titled \"Release on Publish\", and a `workflow_run` run's `head_sha` is `main` HEAD when it starts, so nothing tied a run to the Publish it releases. edity-server can now find it by title and report a failed Release.\n- **`.github/actionlint.yaml`**: actionlint 1.7.12, the newest release, doesn't know `queue` yet, so the file ignores that one error in `release.yml`.\n\nChecked: `mise exec -- actionlint` passes, and jactionlint 2.3.0's correctness profile accepts `queue` without the ignore. Prettier passes on the changed files. The same diff is in RMYPG/static-astro-site-template and RMYPG/edity-sandbox.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/issues/4/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/issues/4/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}
